---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---
<BaseLayout title="Contact RoamDawn" description="Contact the RoamDawn Editorial Team with corrections, questions and feedback."><section class="container max-w-3xl py-14"><h1 class="text-5xl font-black">Contact RoamDawn</h1><p class="mt-5 text-lg text-slate-600">Use the form for corrections, editorial questions or general feedback. It becomes operational when a real form endpoint is configured.</p><form action={import.meta.env.CONTACT_ENDPOINT || '#'} method="post" class="mt-8 grid gap-5 rounded-2xl border bg-white p-7"><label class="font-semibold">Name<input name="name" required class="mt-2 w-full rounded-xl border p-3"/></label><label class="font-semibold">Email<input name="email" type="email" required class="mt-2 w-full rounded-xl border p-3"/></label><label class="font-semibold">Subject<input name="subject" required class="mt-2 w-full rounded-xl border p-3"/></label><label class="font-semibold">Message<textarea name="message" rows="7" required class="mt-2 w-full rounded-xl border p-3"></textarea></label><button class="rounded-full bg-[#168ac0] px-6 py-3 font-bold text-white">Send message</button></form><p class="mt-4 text-sm text-slate-500">Configure CONTACT_ENDPOINT and spam protection before publishing this form as a live service.</p></section></BaseLayout>